[97.061261, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ branch labels ignore key casing, but branch values remain exact \u001b[90m(1.129633ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ label-only resources are grouped and reported as branch-owned, not GC candidates \u001b[90m(0.817899ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ mixed provisioners select exactly the branch, with dependents first \u001b[90m(0.31697ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ genuine external dependents still block teardown \u001b[90m(0.162451ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ selectors parse key=value \u001b[90m(1.507166ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ resources group by branch tag \u001b[90m(0.225893ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ summary warns about untagged resources \u001b[90m(0.339971ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ plan includes untagged resources created by the branch's stack \u001b[90m(0.452629ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ plan deletes dependents before the resources they depend on \u001b[90m(0.363774ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[34mℹ tests 11\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[34mℹ suites 0\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[34mℹ pass 11\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[34mℹ fail 0\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[34mℹ cancelled 0\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[34mℹ skipped 0\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[34mℹ todo 0\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[34mℹ duration_ms 1436.706367\u001b[39m\r\n"]
